    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You take the arrow in the gut! The smell from the wound becomes clearly identifiable as fecal matter spill into your abdominal cavity. Peritonitis is already knocking on your door!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and @Condition[Prone]. Also, you contract @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.M8XyRs9DN12XsFTQ]{Blood Rot}. You can’t recover 3 of your lost Wounds instead of the usual 1 Wound until the arrow is Extracted. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Hard)</strong> will be required for Extraction.</p>"
    },
